@startuml
' State machine for Order. State names must match the OrderStatus enumeration in the domain model
' (checked by generators/check_models.py). UML rule: one transition from the initial state, no guard -> choice pseudostate. "Requested" in the lab text = Submitted here (Oblig 4 wording).
title Order - state machine
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description

state newOrder <<choice>>
[*] --> newOrder : / register booking request\n(web, or phone via coordinator)
newOrder --> Submitted : [no company approval needed]
newOrder --> AwaitingCompanyApproval : [company order above approval limit]

AwaitingCompanyApproval --> Submitted : company approver approves  (US-31)
AwaitingCompanyApproval --> Cancelled : company approver declines

Submitted --> Approved : coordinator approves [capacity OK]\n/ send confirmation  (US-19)
Submitted --> Rejected : coordinator rejects\n/ send reason
Submitted --> Cancelled : customer withdraws

state Approved : change guest count or allergies [before change deadline]\n    / update kitchen view, log OrderChange  (US-12)
state Approved : 7 days before event / send reminder  (US-13)

Approved --> Cancelled : customer cancels [before event]\n/ apply cancellation terms  (US-15)
Approved --> Cancelled : deposit not paid [wedding, 7 days after approval]\n/ release the date  (US-35)
Approved --> InPreparation : event day [allergies confirmed]  (US-23)

InPreparation --> OutForDelivery : all dishes packed [delivery]  (US-29)
InPreparation --> Delivered : collected [pick-up]  (US-14)
OutForDelivery --> Delivered : driver marks delivered

Delivered --> Invoiced : sale recorded in Fiken\n[monthly EHF or Vipps]  (US-36, US-37)

Invoiced --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]

note right of Approved
  Guest count and allergies can change after
  approval only until the change deadline.
  The deadline is an open question (C-02):
  10:00 the day before (corporate customer)
  vs. 7 days before (event coordinator).
  From InPreparation on, the order is locked.
end note

note bottom of Invoiced
  Payment is tracked separately in
  paymentStatus (NotPaid, DepositPaid,
  Invoiced, Paid).
end note
@enduml
